<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112870" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωσφορ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear</i> or <i>bring light</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				597.33
			</span></i> (poet., <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>); <i>shine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nech.
			</span></i> ap. Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				280.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.511
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				1.65
			</span></i>; esp. of the moon or planets, <i>draw away more than</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				15o
			</span></i>
			<i>from the sun, rise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heph.
			</span></i> Astr.<i><span class="en">
				1.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ φωσφοροῦντες τόποι</span>
			the positions <i>of such risings</i> in the zodiac, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				89
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> trans.,
				<i>bring into the light,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔμβρυα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
					<u>in Alc.</u>
					p.12
				</span></i>
			 C.</div>
